      ],
      "text": "Stir in the {tomato-paste} [flour: and the {flour}] and cook for a moment. Add the {worcestershire} and the {stock} [herbs: with the {herbs}], bring to a simmer and cook gently, part covered, until the sauce is thick and rich. [peas: Stir in the {peas:plural} at the end.] Season with {salt} and {black-pepper}. Check against a trusted guide to doneness.",
